Diagnosed tile provider referer issue and devised server solutions

Classic problem — when the map opens via file://, the browser sends no Referer header, and some tile CDNs (especially OpenTopoMap and some ESRI endpoints) reject that with 403. The clean fix is to spin up a tiny local HTTP server instead of opening the file directly, which gives requests a proper http://localhost origin. I'll also swap the topo provider to one that's permissive.
Decided to reconstruct file completely instead of incremental edits

